{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_381430","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Boss！我有个主意。\n听我说。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"这次又是什么？\n我可不打算去八卦小报上登广告。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不是那回事。\n难得MSF人数也多起来了，\n我想组建一个“情报班”。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"如果把情报员派到哥斯达黎加各地，\n就能提前获得当地情报。\n以后不管要去哪里，应该都不至于措手不及。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"主意不错。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":16,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我还想让情报班开发一些\n用于搜索敌情的装备。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"应该还能让他们运送物资，\n或者引导来自Mother Base的攻击支援。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"想给CO-OP伙伴发送道具的话，\n就在菜单里选择<R=『DELIVERY』,DELIVERY>。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=『DELIVERY』,DELIVERY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}